   "source": [
    "## Gallery — top Hα detections\n",
    "\n",
    "Each panel shows the **median-stacked spectrum** (colour) with individual\n",
    "exposures overplotted in grey.  The x-axis is cropped to ±0.018 µm around the\n",
    "expected H$\\alpha$ position (dashed red line).  The [NII]λ6583 doublet marker\n",
    "is shown in orange where it falls within the window."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 5,
   "id": "sc-gallery",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Excluded 192 IFU(s) with offset > 4.0 px (sky/edge artefact fallback).\n"
     ]
    },
    {
     "data": {
